r.az(0,"ClipComponent",new A.bl5(),"https://github.com/flame-engine/flame/blob/main/examples/lib/stories/components/clip_component_example.dart","Tap on the objects to increase their size and see how the clip component\nworks.")
r.az(0,"Component Pool",new A.bl6(),"https://github.com/flame-engine/flame/blob/main/examples/lib/stories/components/component_pool_example.dart","Tap on the screen to spawn a burst of pooled balls. Watch the stats to see active vs pooled balls and observe how the pool efficiently reuses objects.")
